Package: definetti
Type: Package
Title: de Finetti (Simplex) Plots for Allele Frequencies and Individual Composition
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Gilchrist", email = "difinetti@utk.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: ggplot2 routines that plot compositions of two, three or four
    components (allele frequencies, genotype frequencies or the ancestry
    fractions of individuals) in the reduced-dimension de Finetti space: a line,
    a triangle, or a projected tetrahedron. A component can alternatively be
    shown as perceptually uniform colour. Appearance is controlled through
    plain arguments built on a ggplot2 theme.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), grid, stats, utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
